## The Ask
Please follow the guide lines and make sure this project comply with the layer 8 guide lines.
Please cover all the gaps you find, specially for end 2 end testing using Playwright vs a kind cluster.
Make sure you have full end 2 end tests for all this project functionality, do not omite anything! 
Once you have a full suite of end 2 end tests, please execute them in the following loop:
Run all tests -> RCA Failures -> Fix the failures -> Patch the kind cluster -> re-run the tests.
The exit criteria is a clean run of all the end 2 end tests.
Please continue all the way to the end, do not stop unless you hit a blocker.
